---
---

<section id="about" class="relative py-28 md:py-36" style="background:#0f0d0a;">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">

    <!-- Section label -->
    <div class="reveal text-center mb-14">
      <span class="section-label">About</span>
      <div class="rule-short"></div>
      <h2
        style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.75rem); font-weight:400; color:#f5e9cc; letter-spacing:0.04em; margin-top:0.5rem;"
      >
        Experience magic and mind reading in an interactive evening that will leave you and your guests questioning what is possible, and talking about your gathering for weeks after.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">

      <!-- Left: pull quote + bio -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <blockquote class="pull-quote reveal reveal-delay-1">
He knew the name of a friend I hadn’t talked to in years. And where did that f***king watch come from?
        </blockquote>

        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 space-y-5" style="color:#c4b49a; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.85;">
          <p>
            Solomon Strange has spent over thirty years in the company of secrets. A Mentalist, Magician, Storyteller, and occasional inconvenience to those who prefer their inner thoughts to be kept private, he performs for audiences who appreciate the difference between just watching a trick, and having an experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            Solomon Strange was born and raised in the Appalachian Mountains of West Virginia, where he learned a tradition of Magic, Storytelling, and performing that is older than the modern stage. He is often asked whether he is truly reading minds, but you’ll have to decide that for yourself. Solomon’s Magic and Mentalism shows are designed to be interactive, involving everyone in the room. Even on larger theater stages, Solomon keeps the entire audience engaged and wondering what is about to happen next.  
          </p>
          <p>
          Solomon works seamlessly with large events, adding to the festivities without adding to the stress. His previous career in outdoor education and event coordination gave him years of experience planning and running large events, so he understands what’s going on behind the scenes. This is why he is always on time, reliable, and flexible to changes. The astonishment, when it comes, is the only surprise anyone is asked to accommodate.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: credentials + photo placeholder -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 space-y-8">

        <!-- Photo placeholder — replace src with real photo -->
        <div
          class="relative w-full aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden"
          style="border: 1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.2);"
        >
         
          <img
            src="/images/solomon-headshot.jpg"
            alt="Solomon Strange, mentalist and storyteller based in Oklahoma City"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
            style="filter: contrast(1.05) sepia(0.15);"
          />
          <!-- Gold corner accents -->
          <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 block w-5 h-5" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5); border-left:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5);"></span>
          <span class="absolute top-3 right-3 block w-5 h-5" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5); border-right:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5);"></span>
          <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 block w-5 h-5" style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5); border-left:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5);"></span>
          <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 block w-5 h-5" style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5); border-right:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5);"></span>
        </div>

        <!-- Credentials -->
        <ul class="space-y-3" style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1rem; color:#9a8870; letter-spacing:0.05em;">
          <li style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.12); padding-bottom:0.75rem; display:flex; gap:0.75rem;">
            <span style="color:#b8924a;" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            Thirty years of experience
          </li>
          <li style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.12); padding-bottom:0.75rem; display:flex; gap:0.75rem;">
            <span style="color:#b8924a;" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            Top-rated on GigSalad · Award-winning performer
          </li>
          <li style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.12); padding-bottom:0.75rem; display:flex; gap:0.75rem;">
            <span style="color:#b8924a;" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            Corporate events, private gatherings, theater &amp; stage
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.75rem;">
            <span style="color:#b8924a;" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            Oklahoma City, Tulsa & Beyond
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
